    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17876" root="زفر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزْفُورٌ</span></b>  A beast, (K,) or camel, (TA,) <i>having his
joints strongly knit together.</i> (K, TA.) You say
also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَزْفُورُ الخَلْقِ</span> [<i>He is strongly compacted
in make</i>]. (TA.)

